        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After moving out of state to live with who is a now ex-partner of yours, you now live alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your town-home feels empty and the ticking of your watch on the bookshelf keeps you company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talking with your mom, family and friends aren't quite enough, will you make it out of here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things seem hopeless and the distance and loneliness were enough. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though, it's not so lonely anymore with the company you've discovered. There's no peace of mind and you'll never get out, will you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story based game, takes you on a small novelistic adventure into some disturbing scenarios, building up psychological horror aspects and blending it with a story to take with you to bed at night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopefully the shadows in your room greet you, though, in a manner that is more welcoming.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After moving out of state to live with who is a now ex-partner of yours, you now live alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your town-home feels empty and the ticking of your watch on the bookshelf keeps you company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talking with your mom, family and friends aren't quite enough, will you make it out of here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things seem hopeless and the distance and loneliness were enough. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though, it's not so lonely anymore with the company you've discovered. There's no peace of mind and you'll never get out, will you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story based game, takes you on a small novelistic adventure into some disturbing scenarios, building up psychological horror aspects and blending it with a story to take with you to bed at night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopefully the shadows in your room greet you, though, in a manner that is more welcoming.</p>",
        "short_description": "A reading focused horror game building on atmosphere and user choices, it allows the player to make choices that determine whether they make it out alive or not.",
